---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="Software & Methods | Rajarshi Roy">
  <section class="page-hero"><p>SOFTWARE & COMPUTATIONAL METHODS</p><h1>Building tools to understand molecular motion.</h1><div>My computational work connects molecular simulation methodology with reproducible analysis, enhanced sampling, and high-performance molecular dynamics.</div></section>
  <section class="project-grid">
    <article><span>01</span><h2>Path-Based Enhanced Sampling</h2><p>Adaptive approaches for characterizing rare biomolecular transitions and conformational pathways.</p><small>ENHANCED SAMPLING · MOLECULAR DYNAMICS</small></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h2>GPU Molecular Simulation</h2><p>High-performance molecular simulation workflows for exploring protein conformational dynamics at biologically relevant timescales.</p><small>OPENMM · CHARMM · HPC</small></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h2>Trajectory Analysis</h2><p>Reproducible analysis workflows for extracting structural, dynamical, and mechanistic information from molecular trajectories.</p><small>PYTHON · MDANALYSIS · STRUCTURAL BIOLOGY</small></article>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>.page-hero{padding:9rem 0 7rem;max-width:900px}.page-hero>p{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.22em;font-weight:800;opacity:.5}.page-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.5rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-weight:900;margin:1rem 0 2rem}.page-hero div{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.75;opacity:.65;max-width:700px}.project-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;padding-bottom:8rem}.project-grid article{min-height:24rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid color-mix(in oklab,currentColor 12%,transparent);border-radius:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.project-grid span{font-size:4rem;font-weight:900;opacity:.08}.project-grid h2{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin-top:auto}.project-grid p{line-height:1.65;opacity:.6;margin:1.2rem 0 2rem}.project-grid small{letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:800;opacity:.4}@media(max-width:800px){.page-hero{padding:6rem 0 4rem}.project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
